# --- controlled artifacts: deny-list by extension ---
#
# NOTE: controlled artifacts that are ALREADY in the tree are
# grandfathered by the explicit path allow-list below and by CI's
# allow-listed set. Any NEW file matching one of these extensions is
# blocked here first, and blocked again in .github/workflows/ci.yml
# unless it is added to both allow-lists (which requires the owner
# sign-offs described in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).
*.onnx
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.so
*.so.*
*.dll
*.dylib
*.lib
*.whl
*.bag
*.mcap

# --- explicit allow-list: grandfathered controlled artifacts ---
!onnxruntime_sdk/lib/libonnxruntime.so
!onnxruntime_sdk/lib/libonnxruntime.so.1.10.0
!tron2_controllers/config/SF_TRON2A/policy/policy.onnx
!tron2_controllers/config/SF_TRON2A/policy/encoder.onnx
!tron2_controllers/config/WF_TRON2A/policy/policy.onnx
!tron2_controllers/config/WF_TRON2A/policy/encoder.onnx

# --- generated / scratch ---
/tmp/
/out/
*.log
